  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.19 “Host hall” means “host hall” as defined in RSA 287-E:1, X, namely “a commercial hall or charitable organization approved by the commission where a shared carry-over coverall game originates.”\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.16)",
